---
description: Supabase Edge Functions (Deno) conventions for BabiTk
globs: supabase/functions/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Deno runtime. Import shared code from `../_shared/*.ts` (and `../../../convex/lib/ingest/*.ts` with explicit `.ts` extensions). Check with `deno check supabase/functions/<name>/index.ts`.
- Read secrets via `Deno.env.get(...)` / `_shared/runtime-env.ts`. Never log or return tokens or keys; compare secrets with `_shared/safe-compare.ts`.
- Webhooks fail closed: missing config means 401/503, never open access.
- `whatsapp-green-webhook` must keep answering Green-API quickly with 2xx for accepted calls. Do slow work (ASR, OCR, LLM) with bounded timeouts and retries.
- ASR/OCR: use free providers only (Groq, Gemini free tier, Hugging Face). Do not add paid OpenAI models.
- Schema changes go in `supabase/migrations/` (timestamped). `supabase db push` runs before the functions deploy, so never drop a column that the currently deployed code still reads.
- Keep the Hebrew user-facing messages in Hebrew.
